OL,3,GNEWSA'Extremely rare' Roman coins up
OL,4,Afor sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Roman coins described by
OL,7,Fauctioneers as "extremely rare" are
OL,8,Fexpected to fetch thousands of pounds
OL,9,Fat auction after being unearthed in a
OL,10,Fsmall village.
OL,12,FThe silver denarii - the plural form of
OL,13,Fan ancient Roman silver coin - were
OL,14,Fdiscovered by a metal detectorist in
OL,15,FWestbury-on-Severn, Gloucestershire in
OL,16,FJune 2023.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
