OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'Extremely rare' Roman coins up
OL,4,Afor sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FEstimated to date back to AD 286-293,
OL,7,Fthe coins each feature a bust of
OL,8,FCarausius, an officer in the Roman
OL,9,Fmilitary service who created a
OL,10,Fshort-lived independent state in
OL,11,FBritain.
OL,13,FDominic Chorney, head of ancient coins
OL,14,Fat Stanley Gibbons Baldwin's Auction
OL,15,FHouse, said of the coins: "Each one is
OL,16,Fa really important piece of economic
OL,17,Fhistory, propaganda and social
OL,18,Fhistory."
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
